# Cloned from the March 2026 vintage by `etl update` — every field below still describes it.
#   - description:      "As of March 24, 2025 ... 2,584 country-year data points" -> new as-of
#                       date and counts. NOTE the year in that sentence is already wrong: the
#                       vintage it describes is 20260324, so it should read 2026.
#   - version_producer: Version 16 -> the new percentile-file version
#   - citation_full:    the two `20260324_*` vintage strings, and the release year
